            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Cove 0.1.68</title></head><body><h1>Faster writing, and everyone in To</h1><ul><li>Typing a new email or a reply, moving between emails and opening a conversation are faster: Cove no longer re-scans the whole mailbox as you go.</li><li>The To field suggests anyone you’ve emailed, not only recent mail. After a short pause, Cove looks up matching names and addresses in Gmail; it never reads the emails’ text for this.</li><li>Loading older mail, label views, search results and images inside emails is faster.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
